data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "synth-1", "text": "Drafted 'rb_dual_probe_sas_with_fpc' on a 890x325 mm plate: 8x mirror, 3x photodiode, 2x sampler, 2x vapor cell, 2x lens, 1x beamsplitter, 1x beam dump. Dual-probe Rb saturated absorption spectroscopy with a Fabry-Perot reference cavity (reproduced from Figure 2). An ECDL at 780.24 nm is directed by M1 down through a thick beam-splitter plate (modelled as two cascaded uncoated samplers BS1 and BS2"}

