"collision", "severity": "warning", "message": "CELL and M5 footprints overlap (40.8 mm apart)", "element_id": "CELL", "segment_id": null, "value": null, "limit": null}, {"id": "beam_through_mount", "severity": "warning", "message": "beam ECDL.t.r passes through CELL's mount without interacting", "element_id": "CELL", "segment_id": "s11", "value": null, "limit": null}, {"id": "no_light", "severity": "info", "message": "CELL receives no light", "element_id": "CELL", "segment_id": null, "value": null, "limit": null}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: DPD: 1.000 mW (need \u2265 0.300)", "element_id": "DPD", "segment_id": null, "value": 1.0, "limit": 0.3}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: DPD_B: 0.950 mW (need \u2265 0.300)", "element_id": "DPD_B", "segment_id": null, "value": 0.9500000000000001, "limit": 0.3}, {"id": "target", "severity": "info", "message": "met: PD1: 1.805 mW (need \u2265 0.800)", "element_id": "PD1", "segment_id": null, "value": 1.8050000000000002, "limit": 0.8}], "metrics": {"input_mw": 20.0, "delivered_mw": 3.7550000000000003, "dumped_mw": 14.440000000000001, "stray_mw": 0.0, "n_elements": 19.0, "n_segments": 18.0, "target.DPD.min_power_mw": 1.0, "target.DPD_B.min_power_mw": 0.9500000000000001, "target.PD1.min_power_mw": 1.8050000000000002, "delivered_fraction": 0.18775000000000003}}, "parent_seq": 2, "diff": [{"op": "move", "element_id": "M4", "field": "distance_mm", "from": 189.0, "to": 192.0, "note": "distance_mm: 189 \u2192 192 \u2014 Increased distance_mm from 189 to 192 mm (measured after CELL at x=406 mm) so M4 sits at x=598 mm downstream of CELL."}, {"op": "move", "element_id": "M5", "field": "distance_mm", "from": 259.0, "to": 246.0, "note": "distance_mm: 259 \u2192 246 \u2014 Increased distance_mm from 259 to 246 mm (measured after CELL at x=406 mm) so M5 sits at x=652 mm instead of x=384 mm inside CELL's footprint."}, {"op": "move", "element_id": "L2", "field": "distance_mm", "from": 50.0, "to": 66.0, "note": "distance_mm: 50 \u2192 66"}, {"op": "rotate", "element_id": "M8", "field": "out_direction_deg", "from": 175.0, "to": 170.9, "note": "out_direction_deg: 175 \u2192 170.9 \u2014 Adjusted out_direction_deg to 170.9 deg and BD_PUMP distance_mm to 600 mm so the pump beam counter-propagates through CELL at (406,149) and terminates cleanly upstream of CELL."}, {"op": "move", "element_id": "BD_PUMP", "field": "distance_mm", "from": 220.0, "to": 200.0, "note": "distance_mm: 220 \u2192 200"}], "rationale": "Lengthened the distance_mm of M4 and M5 so they are placed at x=598 mm and x=652 mm (past the Rb vapor cell at x=406 mm, matching the figure coordinates), allowing both probe beams and the counter-propagating pump beam to pass cleanly through CELL without mount collision."}

