data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "repair-2", "text": "Rationale: In the placement pass, M4 and M5 were placed at distance_mm=192 and 246 from BS1 and BS2 (at x=317 and x=371, BEFORE CELL at x=406), so the probe beams folded upward before ever reaching CELL; increasing M4 and M5 distances to 473 mm and 527 mm (and BD_PUMP to 560 mm) places M4 and M5 at x=598 and x=652 after CELL so both probes and the counter-propagating pump traverse CELL cleanly wit"}

